# AI Image Utility Endpoints

**Endpoints:** `/api/ai/image/remove-bg`, `/api/ai/image/upscale`, `/api/ai/image/outpaint`, `/api/ai/image/restore`
**Authentication:** Required
**Rate Limit:** 30 requests per minute
**Provider:** Replicate

---

## Overview

The AI image utility endpoints provide specialized image processing operations powered by Replicate's state-of-the-art models. These endpoints handle common image manipulation tasks including background removal, upscaling, outpainting, and face/image restoration.

### Key Features

- ✅ **Background Removal**: Automatically remove backgrounds using RMBG models
- ✅ **Image Upscaling**: Enhance resolution up to 4x using Real-ESRGAN
- ✅ **Outpainting**: Extend images beyond original boundaries with AI
- ✅ **Face Restoration**: Restore and enhance faces using CodeFormer
- ✅ **Observable**: Datadog LLM tracing for all operations
- ✅ **Secure**: API keys stored server-side, never exposed to client
- ✅ **Consistent Error Handling**: Standardized error responses across all endpoints

