## Best Practices

### 1. Image Format Optimization

```typescript
// Prefer HTTPS URLs over Base64 for large images
const optimizedRequest = {
  image: "https://cdn.example.com/image.jpg", // ✅ Better for large files
  // vs
  // image: "data:image/jpeg;base64,/9j/4AAQ..." // ❌ Large payload
};

// For client-side uploads, use temporary URLs
const uploadAndProcess = async (file: File) => {
  // Upload to temporary storage first
